  {
    "excerpt": "乙型肝炎：表面抗原（Hepatitis B surface antigen，HBsAg）阳性，或核心抗体（Hepatitis B surface antibody，HBcAb）阳性且乙型肝炎病毒脱氧核糖核酸（Hepatitis B virus Deoxyribonucleic acid，HBV-DNA）拷贝数阳性（定义为超过研究中心检测值正常范围上限）；",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究人群",
      "排除标准"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-5706f5359cfe69ab990e29e8",
    "package_ordinal": 55,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p686",
    "source_span_ids": [
